Subject: Adapt original configuration parsing and string ownership

Upstream-base: d6850f8dae162827f94d3f9b01a91538c02849dd

Retain original sections, hashing and typed parsing. Replace Wii array-cookie
and fixed temporary-string storage assumptions, correct native copy-on-write
ranges, check input/table/string bounds and retain temporary ownership on errors.
Delegate file callbacks and global lifetime to explicit native owners. This does
not initialize the tweak registry or select the complete original startup.
Keep native logging routed to the host adapter instead of the console inline
no-op now supplied by the upstream header.

